{"id":"c8f3f2f2b8a397fe","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-constructive-class-dimension.md","title":"类的构造 Hausdorff 维数","display":"df-constructive-class-dimension — 类的构造 Hausdorff 维数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-constructive-class-dimension","aliases":["43-df-constructive-class-dimension"],"display":"df-constructive-class-dimension — 类的构造 Hausdorff 维数","depends_on":["[[43-df-effhausdim]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_locator":"Def.17.3.1, printed p.516 / PDF p.536; universal supermartingale formulation","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-constructive-class-dimension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-constructive-class-dimension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-constructive-class-dimension — 类的构造 Hausdorff 维数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Def.17.3.1, printed p.516 / PDF p.536; universal supermartingale formulation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(E\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；单点有效维数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a>；空集的非负上确界取0。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cdim}(E):=\\sup_{X\\in E}\\dim_H(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cdim}(E):=\\sup_{X\\in E}\\dim_H(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把同一策略覆盖全类的维数与单点维数区分；由通用下半可计算 supermartingale，可等价用全部点有效维数的上确界定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effhausdim]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\subseteq2^\\omega$；单点有效维数见 [[43-df-effhausdim]]；空集的非负上确界取0。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cdim}(E):=\\sup_{X\\in E}\\dim_H(X).","display":true}],"bytes":1054,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-421","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-constructive-class-dimension]] — 类的构造 Hausdorff 维数"},{"id":"e90b41cc3c4bd226","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{CE}(A)$ 且 $A<_T\\varnothing\\prime$；$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]；其余符号见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-constructive-class-dimension]]。"},{"id":"9f8d9248a774beb6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E\\subseteq2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-constructive-class-dimension]]、[[43-df-s-supergale]]、[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]、[[43-df-sgale-success]]。"}],"outgoing":["2114b7d641739c3e"]}